    "minimumScaleFactor(0.5) (+ lineLimit(1)), 자르는 대신 **글자 크기를 줄여서** 공간에 맞춤.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "minimumScaleFactor(0.5) (+ lineLimit(1)) fits text into the space by **shrinking the font size** instead of cutting it."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "minimumScaleFactor(0.5) (+ lineLimit(1)) fits text into the space by **shrinking the font size** instead of cutting it."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "minimumScaleFactor(0.5)（+ lineLimit(1)）。切る代わりに**文字サイズを縮めて**スペースに収める。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "minimumScaleFactor(0.5)（+ lineLimit(1)），不截断，而是**缩小字号**来适应空间。"
